        rdfs:comment                   "Length of fabric in lullingtstone print. Lullingstone scarf.  Blue background with foliate forms in white. Foreground has a large maple leaf taking up much of scarf. Imagery in purple, yellow and pink represents different pieces of machinery: gears, cranks, etc. Signed \"Arnold Lever\" in black cursive."@en ;
